Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:03.10,On Top,,0,0,0,,"February 14\NWednesday"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido! Happy Valentine's!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks, Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm! I'm proud of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.41,0:00:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.87,0:00:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it {\i1}kinako{\i}-flavored?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, you know it!\NI made 'em with all my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My golden wings shall spread and fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Present. We've been waiting\Nto give these to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. And you even came\Nall the way to my classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, how to put it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's incredible. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,--Damn you! Damn you! Damn you!\N--Die! Die! Die!\N--Curse you! Curse you! Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fellow men, let us commence the ritual!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.30,0:01:15.05,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Itsuka"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve every ounce of our hatred!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, eat! Feast upon it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, they're unbelievable...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.78,0:01:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,--Come get it!\N--Come get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.09,0:02:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew chocolate from a girl\Ntasted so much sweeter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:09.02,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Giri Choco"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Praise our saviors! Our goddesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my. You're all so lively this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be so tense.\NLet's save the fun for later, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can't wait. I've already set up\Na room for you in the Spirit dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.14,0:02:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.69,0:04:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.73,0:04:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's new with you, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not much. Just came to\Nask you out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! If you're up for it, I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,--Shall we?\N--Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido... Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:53.39,On Top,,0,0,0,,"1. Home"\N"2. Karaoke"\N"3. Net Café"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, some choices came up.\NLet's decide where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already decided where I'll take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you don't\Ntrust my capabilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that, MARIA...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding. We serve as a support role.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have a strong conviction,\Nyou should follow it. Right, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. After all, he's the world's best\Nspecialist at dealing with Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kotori, MARIA...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. By the way, Shido,\Nthere's somewhere I'd like to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I had somewhere in mind, too.\NProbably the same place as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my. Then let's see if you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:06:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead the way to where\Nyou think I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.26,0:06:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? So this is where\Nyou wanted to bring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to see me in\Nmy underwear that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I do, but that's beside the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,--You guessed right.\N--Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to come here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.41,0:06:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember bringing\None of my clones to this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since, I've always wondered\Nhow the "me" who was with you felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What was she thinking--the "me"\Nwhose heart you managed to steal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Although she was naïve,\Nshe was still "me."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want the same date?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Clone or not, I made\NKurumi Tokisaki fall for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.57,0:07:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you on the same\Ndate as back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of today, you won't\Nbe able to think of anything but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think you can\Nmake me fall for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember this place, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure do. This is where you\Nmade me watch you fight Mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.07,0:07:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.45,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Valentine's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Did you really forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.71,0:08:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It goes to show how much fun I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.05,0:08:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare say, it's one of the\Nbest days I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got something, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Valentine's, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.31,0:08:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no rule against\Na guy giving out chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.15,0:08:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these candied orange peels\Nin the chocolate? Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yours are good, too!\NIs this hazelnut I taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, not bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:05.94,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Happiness Meter"\N"Mood"\N"Mental State"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi isn't lying--she's genuinely\Nenjoying today's date.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't closed her heart off, either.\NIf anything, she's fond of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.69,0:09:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,However, there's something\Nholding her back:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A resolve, some will, or the like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we root out whatever it is,\Nwe won't be able to seal her power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A resolve... Some will...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind telling me why you want\Nto kill the Spirit of Origin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.48,0:09:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard it from Nia?\NWhat a blabbermouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, are you prepared to know the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:10:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,About my... everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost cameras and intercom.\NWe're completely cut off from Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Send some replacements!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.43,0:10:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And how about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A nearby abandoned building.\NIt's one of my bases.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, you said you're prepared to\Nknow everything there is about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:11:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, please take it all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel, Yod.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.10,0:11:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi... Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.07,0:11:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, you're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.31,0:11:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No more climbing up trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That was cool of you, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're like a hero of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always helping the elderly\Nand kids who've lost their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.55,0:12:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Their town destroyed by civil war,\N20,000 refugees have fled to camps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:33.98,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Breaking News"\N"Border Conflict Worsens: "It's like hell...'"\N"Civil War Displaces 20,000 Refugees"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But in these unsanitary camps,\Ndisease runs rampant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi, would you like\Nto come to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Marron would love to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember? The American Shorthair\Nyou played with last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?! You sure you don't mind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not! Marron will love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.86,0:13:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.67,0:13:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A Spirit--monsters which\Ndestroy the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, my name's Kurumi Tokisaki.\NI was just heading home...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.32,0:14:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And wandered here on your own?\NHmm. Perhaps you have the affinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.37,0:14:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Affinity? Who are you exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.71,0:14:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Mio Takamiya.\NYou could say I'm a hero of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.55,0:14:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits are my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're of the same ilk to what attacked\Nyou--monsters which harm the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.10,0:14:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi, do you wish for power?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Power?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.73,0:14:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you're compatible with Sephirah.\NJoin me, and let's save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.99,0:14:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Save... the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I was right about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, don your Spirit armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.89,0:15:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, you should instinctively know\Nyour powers and how to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Deploy Spirit armor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is... me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've long searched for an ally\Nwho could help and fight at my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi Tokisaki, I believe you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:16:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me defeat Spirits and save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel, Het.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:17:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it make me stand out too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.83,0:17:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi? Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawa! N-No, it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eye still isn't better?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, I guess it's one stubborn sty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no good. I hope you get well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.73,0:17:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to come to my place after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.89,0:17:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My aunt's bringing\NMarron's siblings to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?! Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.15,0:17:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm terribly sorry, but I have\Nplans I can't miss today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? That's too bad.\NYou sure are busy lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. But please,\Nask me some other time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,For real! I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi, I'm counting on you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Leave it to me, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy Spirit armor, Elohim!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work. As always,\NI'll take care of the cleanup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.43,0:18:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you. Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hurry, I might be able to visit Sawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:19:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... What if I invited Mio?\NWe haven't had many chances to chat...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's someone you know?\NI'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame. I hoped to have\Nyou as a partner for longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits are humans\Nwho were given Sephirah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's more accurate to say\NI bestowed them my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Z-Zaphkiel, Daletto!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:20:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shocked. You avoided\Ninversion all on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a relief. It'd be bothersome if\Nyour refined Sephirah went back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Inversion? Refined?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.23,0:20:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Initially, Sephirah aren't\Ncompatible with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Unable to control its power,\Nthey go berserk when given one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.53,0:20:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this girl whom you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To make Sephirah compatible with humans,\Nthey must be refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.79,0:20:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, by giving them\Nto humans, over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.76,0:20:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The humans will go berserk, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but in time, the Sephirah\Nwill turn compatible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then will a human with strong\Naffinity remain themselves as a Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,One like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.15,0:21:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But recovering Sephirah can be difficult.\NYou've been a great help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no grudge against you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.45,0:21:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I cannot stop\Nuntil I achieve my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, good night, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.64,0:21:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Spirit took away my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.86,0:21:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The only reason I remember\Nis thanks to Zaphkiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill the Spirit of Origin...\NNo matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.49,0:21:55.00,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 11:\N'Past Sins.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.75,0:23:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi Tokisaki: A Spirit crueler\Nand kinder than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.59,0:23:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is her resolve? What is her will?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Cycle of Salvation."\NThe Worst Spirit shows her devotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:39.98,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 12: 'Cycle of Salvation.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.81,0:23:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.81,0:23:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,
